  "story": {
    "headline": "Mysterious Shapes Hidden Beneath the Amazon Canopy Reveal a Sprawling Ancient Civilization Much Bigger Than Researchers Expected",
    "summary": "Scientists recently discovered hundreds of monumental, geometric earthworks known as \"geoglyphs\" in northern Brazil from the Aquiry civilization",
    "publisher": "Rally News",
    "url": "https://rally.news/categories/world/?article=Mysterious%2BShapes%2BHidden%2BBeneath%2Bthe%2BAmazon%2BCanopy%2BReveal%2Ba%2BSprawling%2BAncient%2BCivilization%2BMuch%2BBigger%2BThan%2BResearchers%2BExpected"
  },
  "researchBrief": "The discovery of over 20,000 geoglyphs in the Amazon, built by the Aquiry civilization, was reported in Nature [nature.com](https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10835-7). These findings were corroborated by Scientific American [scientificamerican.com](https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/hundreds-of-ancient-never-before-seen-earthworks-discovered-in-the-amazon/), the University of Helsinki [helsinki.fi](https://www.helsinki.fi/en/news/culture/ancient-civilization-millions-once-flourished-amazon), and New Scientist [newscientist.com](https://www.newscientist.com/article/2582152-lost-civilisation-in-the-amazon-may-have-numbered-3-million-people/). The geoglyphs, ranging from 0.35 to 50 hectares in size, were constructed between 600 BC and AD 850. The Aquiry civilization's population is estimated to have peaked at 1.25–3 million people around AD 100–300. The use of LiDAR technology allowed researchers to detect these structures beneath the dense forest canopy, revealing a civilization that was much larger and more complex than previously thought. The exact function of the geoglyphs remains uncertain, but they are believed to have served ceremonial or cultural purposes.",
  "sources": [
    "https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-026-10835-7",
    "https://www.scientificamerican.com/article/hundreds-of-ancient-never-before-seen-earthworks-discovered-in-the-amazon/",
    "https://www.helsinki.fi/en/news/culture/ancient-civilization-millions-once-flourished-amazon",
    "https://www.newscientist.com/article/2582152-lost-civilisation-in-the-amazon-may-have-numbered-3-million-people/"
  ],
